                <pb facs="1128" n="1118" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg1118"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">102.1/5–1347: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-05-13T17:00:00-04:00">May 13, 1947—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>571. For Adler from Treasury. Approve completion arrangements for purchase yuan
                    (reurtel 1022, May 11) at Hong Kong cross-rate as of date of purchase. Navy
                    concurs. [Treasury.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
